# {{ .vars.project_name }}

{{ .vars.description | default "A Go project with modular justfile build system." }}

## Prerequisites

- [Go](https://golang.org/dl/) 1.21+
- [just](https://github.com/casey/just) command runner

## Quick Start

```bash
# List available commands
just

# Build the project
just build

# Run tests
just test all

# Install to $GOBIN
just install
```

## Project Structure

```
{{ .vars.project_name }}/
├── Justfile              # Root justfile with mod imports
├── .justfiles/           # Modular just recipes
│   ├── build.just        # Cross-platform build recipes
│   ├── test.just         # Testing recipes
│   └── dev.just          # Development workflow recipes
├── cmd/
│   └── {{ .vars.binary_name | default .vars.project_name }}/
│       └── main.go       # Application entry point
└── bin/                  # Build output directory
```

## Just Modules

This project uses just's module system for organized, scalable task management:

- **xbuild**: Cross-platform build targets (`just xbuild linux`, `just xbuild darwin-arm64`)
- **test**: Testing commands (`just test unit`, `just test coverage`)
- **dev**: Development workflow (`just dev run`, `just dev watch`)

## Common Commands

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `just` | List all available commands |
| `just build` | Build the project |
| `just lint` | Format and vet code |
| `just test all` | Run all tests |
| `just dev run` | Run without building |
| `just xbuild all` | Build for all platforms |
| `just install` | Install to $GOBIN |

